  "description": "For riders unwilling to be confined to one surface, Roadmachine 01 X extends the reach of the faster than ever Roadmachine 01, redefining what's possible in endurance cycling. This gravel-road hybrid has a premium carbon frame and fork, for a ride that’s as smooth as it is responsive, from road to gravel. Featuring Stealth Cable Routing, built-in downtube storage, and our ICS MTT suspension stem, it has all the integration needed to elevate your ride into a class of its own. Complete with SRAM Force XPLR eTap AXS 1x groupset, CRD-321 carbon wheelset and gravel-ready 34mm tires.",
